{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.47, "data": {"request_id": "8a1a26449039", "seq": 29, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:01.967Z", "t_ms": 6419, "delta": " from external observations and distilling this foreseeable reasoning ability from a large model into a compact one [C1, C2]:\n\n* **Decou"}}
