{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.979, "data": {"request_id": "8a1a26449039", "seq": 31, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:02.477Z", "t_ms": 6929, "delta": " reasoning from external tool calls [C1, C2]. Because no tool responses or observations are present during planning, the"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.184, "data": {"request_id": "8a1a26449039", "seq": 32, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:02.683Z", "t_ms": 7134, "delta": " Planner module can be trained purely to optimize the generic ability of \"foreseeable reasoning\" [C2].\n* **Dist"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.388, "data": {"request_id": "8a1a26449039", "seq": 33, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:02.887Z", "t_ms": 7339, "delta": "illation and Instruction Fine-Tuning:** Using a specialization framework, ReWOO offloads foreseeable reasoning from a 175B"}}
