{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.225, "data": {"request_id": "8a1a26449039", "seq": 37, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:03.724Z", "t_ms": 8175, "delta": " filters these down to approximately 2,000 successful blueprints that yield correct answers, creating targeted Planner instruction data [C2].\n  "}}
