{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.9, "data": {"request_id": "8a1a26449039", "seq": 40, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:14:04.393Z", "t_ms": 8844, "delta": " instruction samples using LoRA (Low-Rank Adaptation) to produce **Planner 7B** [C2, C4"}}
